<div class=3D"clearfix"></div>The secondary consideration, here, is that, p=
erhaps, because of the degeneration of people, it=E2=80=99s not so obvious =
that our lifespans are limited=E2=80=94that the spirit that inhabits us wil=
l only do so for a limited amount of time. That=E2=80=99s tangled, in a str=
ange way, in with the idea of human moral culpability. That=E2=80=99s posed=
