ner exactly what they were trying to represent. But what they were represen=
ting were the metaphors at the core of our culture=E2=80=94to the degree th=
at our culture is functional and good. These are the metaphors upon which i=
t=E2=80=99s founded, and they=E2=80=99re not for the faint of heart.=20
