 this panel. So if you are just conjuring up some sort of pathetic wish ful=
fillment, why in the world would you tilt the scales in that manner? You th=
ink that=E2=80=99s supposed to make people feel good? I don=E2=80=99t think=
 so. There=E2=80=99s almost nothing about this picture that should make peo=
