m to the ultimate macrocosm. That=E2=80=99s the way that all being is redee=
med. That=E2=80=99s what the story suggests. As cynical, modern people, we =
read it as if it was written by primitive people, who thought that it was r=
eally the case that someone could build a boat and put two of every kind in=
to it, and thereby save the world. It=E2=80=99s embarrassing to see somethi=
ng interpreted in a manner that shallow=E2=80=94especially by people who do=
n=E2=80=99t have ignorance as a justification.
<br><br>These stories have to appeal to everyone, right? And there=E2=80=99=
s lots of people in the world who aren=E2=80=99t very bright. And so they t=
